{
  "displayName": "GKE ComputeClass: Universal Stockouts & Fallback Operations",
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 12,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 2,
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Universal Multi-Cluster Overview",
          "text": {
            "content": "### Universal GKE ComputeClass & Stockout Monitoring\nThis dashboard is **project-wide and multi-cluster**. It tracks **stockouts** of preferred primary instance types and **successful provisionings broken down by machine family** (`N4`, `N2`, `N2D`, `T2D`, `C3D`, `E2`, etc.) across any GKE cluster in the project.\n\n* **Multi-Cluster**: Automatically monitors all GKE clusters in this project.\n* **Time Window**: Use the time picker in the top right (**1H**, **6H**, **1D**, **7D**) to view live or historical trends.",
            "format": "MARKDOWN"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 4,
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 2,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Instance Stockouts (GCE Pool Exhausted / FailedScaleUp)",
          "xyChart": {
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            },
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "legendTemplate": "Stockouts (${resource.labels.zone})",
                "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s",
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/gke_node_provisioning_stockouts\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "resource.labels.zone"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "Stockout Count",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 6,
        "height": 4,
        "xPos": 6,
        "yPos": 2,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Node Provisioning Successes by Machine Family",
          "xyChart": {
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            },
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "legendTemplate": "Machine Family: ${metric.labels.machine_family}",
                "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s",
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/gke_node_provisioning_successes\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.labels.machine_family"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "Instances Created",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 4,
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 6,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Comparative Trend: Stockouts vs Node Provisionings",
          "xyChart": {
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            },
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "legendTemplate": "Stockouts (Total)",
                "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s",
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/gke_node_provisioning_stockouts\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA"
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "legendTemplate": "Successful Nodes (${metric.labels.machine_family})",
                "minAlignmentPeriod": "60s",
                "plotType": "LINE",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/gke_node_provisioning_successes\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "metric.labels.machine_family"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "Event Count",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "width": 12,
        "height": 8,
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 10,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Details Pane: Raw Autoscaler & Provisioning Activity Logs",
          "logsPanel": {
            "filter": "(resource.type=\"k8s_pod\" AND logName : \"events\" AND jsonPayload.reportingComponent=\"cluster-autoscaler\") OR (logName : \"cloudaudit.googleapis.com%2Factivity\" AND protoPayload.methodName:\"compute.instances.insert\" AND (severity=\"ERROR\" OR protoPayload.resourceName=~\"-nap-\"))",
            "resourceNames": [
              "projects/${PROJECT_ID}"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
